{"414589031223512": {"GUILD": {"1155152569040130101": {"commands": {"ryetbh": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "ryetbh", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:38:28", "editors": [], "response": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1171017496220938352/1247982724346675210/IMG_0300.png?ex=666201fb&is=6660b07b&hm=80ee05ceda22bf44b080a5a6f44fcc8299c905d636be35e42fa50ebdf2d530c2&"}, "lac": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "lac", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:42:56", "editors": [], "response": "https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1042561095740686443/1161228461571051540/image.png?ex=66617c47&is=66602ac7&hm=d08443d01afdaa7cdc9cc9a1132701cab80383e7bc43265d2914f4cb66d520cf&width=1440&height=448&"}, "harak": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "harak", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:49:11", "editors": [], "response": "https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1155152571137273897/1159837311891161108/image.png?ex=6661b2ab&is=6660612b&hm=d2efc59816042b75b3e0fe687920712d0d4c6a33632c900e9dc1fa1427853cd3&width=1202&height=676&"}, "ghs": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "ghs", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:50:03", "editors": [], "response": "I am officially announcing that:\nGrind Hard Squad is the best Warframe youtuber ever. His builds have helped me through tough times in life and Warframe. Without him, i would have never thought that simply pausing the game in solo mode could let me survive in endurance runs for HOURS. Combining Primed Pressure Point and Condition Overload was such a great idea too, it gave me so much more damage because my melee's viral procs make it do 120% extra damage! His builds are truly the best.\nSure, there are other youtubers and streamers like Leamxp and KnightmareFrame, but why would i watch any of them, when i could watch Grind Hard Squad show off the same build 2 weeks later, except in all caps? And it's not like all his builds are the same as other youtubers' builds, like his Khora stat stick with Condition Overload. I haven't seen any of the other youtubers use that, he must have invented that strat first! Why would i watch Relentless Zen when i can watch GHS and get the same build in twice the watchtime?\nThis. Is. The Future.\nHonestly other youtubers are just trash, any hate and allegations about \"stealing builds\" or \"not knowing what he's doing\" are pure jealousy, just because he's so successful. They probably steal his builds from his computer with a virus and then upload before him, so they can frame him as a \"build stealer\". Build stealer more like glorious Squad Leader.\nI just love Grind Hard Squad, he helps me do so much damage to my enemies with my Condition Overload Khora. Khora is just the best, she's so good that the Condition Overload barely even makes a difference, because she's just so good already, even though it's such a good mod.\nAnyway, that's all for now, keep grinding with his amazing builds.\nSquad leader signing off."}, "energize": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "energize", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:50:41", "editors": [], "response": "Damn R5 Energize helped cure my cancer, found my Dad, made my Depression goes away, gave me good grades, got me 6x3 and almost WR in PT, my builds are instantly better by just having R5 Energize, i'm so good at the game, i plays with 0 hands and still lvl cap, Energize 1shot the enemies for me, Energize isn't a choice, It's a life style."}, "quasar": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "quasar", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:51:44", "editors": [], "response": "Quasars \u662f\u8457\u540d\u7684 Warframe \u6218\u961f\uff0c\u4e13\u6ce8\u4e8e\u6b8b\u5c40\u5185\u5bb9\u548c\u7ade\u6280\u6e38\u620f\u73a9\u6cd5\u3002\u5b83\u88ab\u5e7f\u6cdb\u8ba4\u4e3a\u662f\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u6700\u8d1f\u76db\u540d\u7684\u7cbe\u82f1\u6c0f\u65cf\u4e4b\u4e00\u3002\u8be5\u90e8\u843d\u62e5\u6709\u4e00\u4e2a\u9ad8\u5ea6\u6d3b\u8dc3\u548c\u4e13\u6ce8\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\u793e\u533a\uff0c\u4ed6\u4eec\u5171\u540c\u52aa\u529b\u89e3\u51b3\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e9b\u6700\u5177\u6311\u6218\u6027\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u9ad8\u7ea7\u522b\u7a81\u88ad\u3001\u65e0\u5c3d\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\u548c\u7ade\u4e89\u6027 PvP \u6bd4\u8d5b\u3002\n\n\u7c7b\u661f\u4f53\u88ab\u8ba4\u4e3a\u662f Warframe \u4e2d\u6700\u597d\u7684\u6c0f\u65cf\u6709\u51e0\u4e2a\u539f\u56e0\u3002\u4e3b\u8981\u539f\u56e0\u4e4b\u4e00\u662f\u90e8\u843d\u6ce8\u91cd\u56e2\u961f\u5408\u4f5c\u3002 Quasars \u7684\u6210\u5458\u7d27\u5bc6\u5408\u4f5c\uff0c\u5206\u4eab\u77e5\u8bc6\u548c\u7b56\u7565\uff0c\u8fd9\u6709\u52a9\u4e8e\u4ed6\u4eec\u5e94\u5bf9\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e9b\u6700\u56f0\u96be\u7684\u6311\u6218\u3002\u6b64\u5916\uff0c\u8be5\u90e8\u843d\u5177\u6709\u5f3a\u70c8\u7684\u793e\u533a\u610f\u8bc6\uff0c\u6210\u5458\u7ecf\u5e38\u5728\u6e38\u620f\u4e4b\u5916\u8fdb\u884c\u793e\u4ea4\u548c\u73a9\u800d\u3002\n\n\u8981\u52a0\u5165 Quasars\uff0c\u73a9\u5bb6\u5fc5\u987b\u6ee1\u8db3\u7279\u5b9a\u8981\u6c42\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u62e5\u6709\u8d85\u8fc7 1000 \u5c0f\u65f6\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u65f6\u95f4\u5e76\u80fd\u591f\u5728\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u5c55\u793a\u9ad8\u6c34\u5e73\u7684\u6280\u80fd\u548c\u77e5\u8bc6\u3002\u6c0f\u65cf\u6709\u4e25\u683c\u7684\u62db\u52df\u6d41\u7a0b\uff0c\u8fd9\u6709\u52a9\u4e8e\u786e\u4fdd\u65b0\u6210\u5458\u80fd\u591f\u5f88\u597d\u5730\u9002\u5e94\u6c0f\u65cf\u7684\u6587\u5316\u548c\u6e38\u620f\u98ce\u683c\u3002"}, "endo": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "endo", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:52:33", "editors": [], "response": "I LOVE ENDO <:endo4life:1042596506751995934> \nI WILL LEAVE MY JOB AND FARM ENDO 24/7   \ud83d\udd25 \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f \nENDO IS LIFE\nENDO IS MY JOB\nFARMIN IS MY LIFE   \ud83d\udd25 \ud