: "ryetbh"}, "command": "knightmare", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 18:59:23", "editors": [], "response": "For the people that don\u2019t understand why there frame is bad and are crying about it remember Knightmare isn\u2019t a casual wf player he\u2019s a high endurance player so when it comes to tier list he makes them off what will do good at high levels and how well they can get the job done. Yes any frame can go to high levels BUT Frames are better than others and that\u2019s how every game is if you\u2019re A CASUAL PLAYER THIS ISNT FOR YOU! But if you\u2019re looking to learn and are open to new things then this is for you \ud83d\udc4d"}, "coque": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "coque", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 19:00:25", "editors": [], "response": "https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1155152572672389185/1229513471998169158/image.png?ex=666164e6&is=66601366&hm=22040f43cc85f8128c4c7bcdd92c549ed996509c40d2864c98641cd21a7bac05&format=webp&quality=lossless&"}, "barenrizz": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "barenrizz", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 19:02:49", "editors": [], "response": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1155152572672389185/1235959572389298278/image.png?ex=6661c60d&is=6660748d&hm=6ef83c413537310f2606592a6528e3d2e8c4578b8d977cd5f15b1f92df94826d&"}, "kal": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "kal", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 19:03:46", "editors": [], "response": "https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1155152572672389185/1235962459844509787/kalel.png?ex=6661c8bd&is=6660773d&hm=7b91b0f11a588558c2e761e714bddcb80855bcbd7a69bbb66292aa3a40ee272d&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=812&height=597&"}, "shrooms": {"author": {"id": 457488447712788480, "name": "ryetbh"}, "command": "shrooms", "cooldowns": {}, "created_at": "05/06/2024 19:04:48", "editors": [], "response": "https://media.